= June 2025 — Confidence is not strategy

[? if left_in_government: The cabinet can close ranks, reopen the agreement, or
change prime minister. Each choice faces a seat-derived roll call.?]
[? if not left_in_government: The government seeks confidence without the
Left in cabinet. Lewica can oppose, abstain for policy or rescue it.?]

- @confidence_close
- @confidence_renegotiate
- @confidence_replace
- @confidence_opposition

@confidence_close
title: Close ranks behind the existing cabinet
view-if: left_in_government = 1
on-arrival: confidence_2025_bonus = 4; government_coalition_dissent -= 3; party_unity -= 1; news_headline = "The coalition treats confidence as a discipline vote"
go-to: confidence_2025_roll

@confidence_renegotiate
title: Sign a dated delivery protocol before voting confidence
subtitle: Cost: 2 resources.
view-if: left_in_government = 1
choose-if: resources >= 2
unavailable-subtitle: The Left cannot staff another coalition negotiation.
on-arrival: resources -= 2; confidence_2025_bonus = 8; budget_promises += 3; party_unity += 2; razem_cooperation += 3; ko_relation -= 2; psl_relation -= 1; news_headline = "Confidence receives labour, housing and health deadlines"
go-to: confidence_2025_roll

@confidence_replace
title: Demand a new prime minister and coalition opening
view-if: left_in_government = 1
on-arrival: confidence_2025_bonus = -4; confidence_candidate = "Democratic coalition replacement"; ko_relation -= 10; psl_relation += 2; p2050_relation += 3; government_coalition_dissent += 9; early_election_risk += 10; news_headline = "The coalition searches for a successor before proving it can dismiss the incumbent"
go-to: confidence_2025_roll

@confidence_opposition
title: Decide the vote from opposition
view-if: left_in_government = 0
on-arrival: confidence_2025_bonus = -2; party_unity += 1; news_headline = "The Left prices its confidence vote from outside government"
go-to: confidence_2025_roll

@confidence_2025_roll
title: The June confidence roll call
new-page: true
on-arrival: {!
let governingSeats = Number(Q.coalition_seats);
if (!Number.isFinite(governingSeats) || governingSeats <= 0) {
    governingSeats =
        (Number(Q.ko_seats) || 0) +
        (Number(Q.psl_seats) || 0) +
        (Number(Q.p2050_seats) || 0) +
        (Q.left_in_government ? (Number(Q.left_seats) || 0) : 0);
}
const dissentLoss = Math.max(
    0,
    Math.round(
        (
            (Number(Q.government_coalition_dissent) || 0) - 30
        ) / 7
    )
);
const randomLoss = Math.floor(
    (this.random.uint32() / 4294967296) * 6
);
Q.confidence_yes = Math.max(
    0,
    Math.min(
        460,
        Math.round(governingSeats) -
            dissentLoss -
            randomLoss +
            (Number(Q.confidence_2025_bonus) || 0)
    )
);
Q.confidence_abstain = Math.min(
    460 - Q.confidence_yes,
    20,
    Math.max(0, Math.round(dissentLoss / 2) + 4)
);
Q.confidence_no = Math.max(
    0,
    460 - Q.confidence_yes - Q.confidence_abstain
);
Q.confidence_threshold = 231;
Q.confidence_present = 460;
Q.government_has_confidence = Q.confidence_yes >= 231 ? 1 : 0;
Q.coalition_confidence_2025_done = 1;
if (Q.government_has_confidence) {
    Q.government_coalition_dissent -= 3;
    Q.public_trust += 1;
    Q.news_headline =
        "The cabinet survives with " + Q.confidence_yes + " votes";
} else {
    Q.coalition_broken = 1;
    Q.caretaker_government = 1;
    Q.left_in_government = 0;
    Q.budget = 0;
    Q.position = "Caretaker cabinet and formation talks";
    Q.early_election_risk = Math.max(70, Q.early_election_risk);
    Q.news_headline =
        "The cabinet loses confidence with " + Q.confidence_yes + " votes";
}
!}

= Confidence roll call

**Yes [+ confidence_yes +] · No [+ confidence_no +] · Abstain [+
confidence_abstain +]**

[? if government_has_confidence: The cabinet survives. The vote proves 231;
it does not settle candidate strategy, delivery or trust.?]
[? if not government_has_confidence: The cabinet falls. A named constructive
replacement or the constitutional formation ladder must now find a majority.?]

- @confidence_return: Record the vote

@confidence_return
go-to: poland_event_queue

